#readmeHeader()

This example demonstrates how to implement and register a custom
DDS_ContentFilterI content filter with RTI Connext DDS Micro.

Key features:
  - Custom filter implemented in the application module
    (${envMap.idlFileName}Application.h / ${envMap.idlFileName}Application.c)
  - DPDE dynamic endpoint discovery
  - Writer-side filtering: publisher registers the custom filter so
    it can evaluate the filter on behalf of matching readers
  - Reader-side filtering: subscriber registers the custom filter
    and configures DataReader QoS with a content filter expression

